## Derivative work

ScreenMine is a port of **CoScreen** (1.21.4 → Minecraft 26.3). CoScreen was
authored by **Ma3stro567** and was distributed under the AGPL-3.0. Substantial
parts of its source code — including `BrowserInstance`, `PlaybackSync`,
`AppState`, `StreamInfo`, `Packets`, `NetClient`, `Cfg`, `Settings`, `Lang`,
`ScreenWorld` and `PlacedScreen` — were carried over into this project and
modified.

Under AGPL-3.0 §5(a), this work is therefore distributed under the same licence,
and §4 requires that the copyright and licence notices above be preserved. The
original CoScreen copyright notice is retained here.

Note: CoScreen's own `LICENSE` file contains only the unmodified FSF boilerplate
and names no copyright holder, so the attribution above is taken from the
`authors` field of its `fabric.mod.json`.

## Changes made

The port replaces, among other things:

- Yarn mappings with Mojang names (Minecraft 26.1+ ships unobfuscated)
- GLFW with SDL3
- the `RenderSystem` render-state API with `RenderPipeline` / `RenderPipeline`
  world-space submission via `com.mojang.renderpearl`
- CinemaMod MCEF (dead at 1.21.4) with `mcef-modern`
- the mod, package and asset identities: CoScreen → ScreenMine

